===Etymology===
From {{der|it|fro|spole}}, {{m|fro|espole}}, from {{der|it|dum|spoele}}, from {{der|it|odt|*spōla}}, {{m|odt|*spuola}}, from {{der|it|gem-pro|*spōlǭ||spool}}. More at {{m|en|spool}}.

