==Swedish==

===Verb===
{{sv-verb-reg}}

# {{lb|sv|often with a particle, especially {{m|sv|av||off}}}} to [[flush]] (let water (or another liquid) flow over, usually in order clean, and usually at pressure), (when cleaning) to [[wash]], to hose off, to [[rinse]], etc.
#: {{ux|sv|Han '''spolade av''' altanen|He '''hosed off''' the balcony}}
# to [[flush]] (a toilet)
#: {{ux|sv|'''spola''' toaletten|'''flush''' the toilet}}
#: {{ux|sv|Du glömde '''spola'''|You forgot '''to flush'''}}
# {{lb|sv|figuratively}} to [[flush]] (get rid of something that no longer seems desirable)
#: {{ux|sv|Vi '''spolar''' den idén. Det kommer inte funka.|Let's '''flush''' that idea. It won't work.}}
# to [[reel]], to [[spool]], to [[wind]] (quickly wind on a spool or reel or the like)
#: {{uxi|sv|'''spola tillbaka''' bandet|'''rewind''' the tape}}
#: {{uxi|sv|'''spola fram''' bandet|'''fast forward''' the tape}}
#: {{uxi|sv|'''spola upp''' ny tråd|'''wind''' new thread}}

